BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 769.0 Td (3. Enrolment) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 750.0 Td (How do I apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 736.0 Td (Register at a Common Service Centre.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 717.0 Td (What should I bring?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 703.0 Td (Aadhaar, Mobile number, Bank account. Bring them in person; never read document numbers out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 689.0 Td (on the phone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 670.0 Td (Do I have to pay to apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 656.0 Td (There is no fee to apply. Any premium or contribution is only what is stated under What it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 642.0 Td (gives. Never pay anyone or share an OTP to apply.) Tj ET
